---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Pantaloni cu snur lung | ghid complet pantaloni cu snur lung';
const description = 'Pantaloni cu snur lung, pantaloni cu snur lung explicati simplu, informatii clare si optiuni utile pentru cumparare. Vezi detalii acum!';
const canonical = 'https://pantalonicusnurlung.ro/';
const schema = { '@context':'https://schema.org', '@type':'WebPage', name:title, url:canonical };
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} schema={schema}>
<section class="bg-white border-b border-ink/10">
  <div class="section grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr]">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">pantaloni cu snur lung</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-black leading-tight md:text-6xl">Pantaloni cu snur lung explicati simplu</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-ink/70">Un hub informational despre croiala, materiale, marimi, stil si ingrijire pentru pantaloni cu snur lung.</p>
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="btn-primary" href="/pantaloni-lungi">Pantaloni cu snur lung</a><a class="btn-secondary" href="/blog">Ghiduri si idei</a></div>
    </div>
    <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-mist">
      <img src="/og-pantaloni-cu-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni cu snur lung in tinuta casual clara si moderna" title="Pantaloni cu snur lung" width="1200" height="630" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" class="aspect-[1200/630] w-full object-cover" />
      <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink/65">Pantaloni cu snur lung prezentati natural pentru inspiratie de stil.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Definitie clara</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/70">Pagina explica pantaloni cu snur lung cu exemple simple si legaturi catre colectia Atelieraxd.</p></article><article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Cum alegi</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/70">Masuratori, materiale si sezon: trei criterii care conteaza pentru pantaloni cu snur lung.</p></article><article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">CTA comercial</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/70">Fiecare pagina trimite natural catre atelieraxd.ro cu ancora ceruta.</p></article></div></section><section class="bg-ink text-white"><div class="section grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr]"><h2 class="text-3xl font-black">Legatura catre magazin</h2><p class="text-lg leading-8 text-white/75">Dupa informare, utilizatorul are un pas clar catre pantaloni cu snur lung atelieraxd, fara nofollow si fara bariere inutile.</p></div></section><section class="section text-center"><a class="btn-primary" href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi">pantaloni cu snur lung atelieraxd</a></section><section class="section"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Ghid principal</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/70">Citeste pagina dedicata pentru pantaloni cu snur lung.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex font-semibold text-clay" href="/pantaloni-cu-snur-lung">Vezi pagina</a></article><article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Marimi</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/70">Invata cum sa masori talia si lungimea.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex font-semibold text-clay" href="/ghid-marimi-pantaloni-cu-snur">Vezi pagina</a></article><article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Stil</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/70">Vezi idei de purtare pe sezon.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex font-semibold text-clay" href="/cum-sa-porti-pantaloni-cu-snur">Vezi pagina</a></article></div></section>
</Layout>
